      "mergedPostDetails": "I love the idea of groups but currently cannot use them for the events I throw. What would be great for my club and many other music clubs is, Friends+ Group Instances. This would essentially be a Friends+ instance with Group Privileges given to members. I think VRChat would get a lot of positive feedback for this feature!",
