      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please, please implement this! All we need is an option for “friend invites allowed” when creating a group instance and/or on the role level.\n\nSo many clubs, including ours, grow by word of mouth, and inviting a friend while in an instance is so much lower friction than instructing them to join the group, etc. This is the one thing currently holding our club back from dedicated groups implementation.\n\nIt would be a game-changer for clubs and the music scene on VRC.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
